  "summary": "michaelbakerportfolio.com\n\nPROFILE\nCreative Front-end developer with experience in open-source projects and real-world consulting, passionate about problem-solving and fostering a friendly team atmosphere. Seeking a web developer position, eager to apply strong communication skills and collaborate on advanced solutions.\n\nSUMMARY OF QUALIFICAITONS\n·\tProficient in JavaScript, TypeScript, CSS, and HTML, with extensive experience using React, Material-UI, and Docker\n·\tTrack record of delivering projects on time, including secure patient data transfer systems and user-friendly web applications\n·\tStrong communication and interpersonal skills, demonstrated through client training sessions and consultations\n·\tCommitted to contributing to a collaborative team environment and creating innovative software engineering solutions\n\nSKILLS\nLanguages: JavaScript, TypeScript, CSS, HTML, Lua\nFrameworks and Technologies: React, Node, Bash, Docker, Git, CI/CD, Firebase, Material-UI, Webpack, Websockets, REST API\nSoft Skills: Communication, detail orientation, problem solving, time management, adaptability, training, and mentorship\n\nPROJECTS AND RELEASES\n• Netflix Helper - Google play store app with over 1000 downloads\n• Scootloops - Open-source NPM package that provides intuitive looping and filtering functions\n• Lettler.com - A digital vault for storing and retrieving small messages anonymously\n• Best HTML Snippets - Extends HTML snippets for beginners for more complete and efficient syntax",
